			<div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="37" class="elementor elementor-37">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00000 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="e00000" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
					<style id="exjsx-raw-ykrhga-0">.elementor-element-e00000{margin:0 !important;height:0;line-height:0;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e00004-s.e-ykrhga-e00004-s{& { border-bottom: 1px solid #26313C; }}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0000m-s.e-ykrhga-e0000m-s{& { border-top: 1px solid #26313C; }}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0000p-s.e-ykrhga-e0000p-s{& { border-top: 1px solid #26313C; }}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0000s-s.e-ykrhga-e0000s-s{& { border-top: 1px solid #26313C; }}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e00019-s.e-ykrhga-e00019-s{& { overflow: hidden; }}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0001e-s.e-ykrhga-e0001e-s{& { overflow: hidden; }}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0002k-s.e-ykrhga-e0002k-s{& { border-bottom: 1px solid #26313C; }}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0002n-s.e-ykrhga-e0002n-s{& { border-bottom: 1px solid #26313C; }}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0002q-s.e-ykrhga-e0002q-s{& { border-bottom: 1px solid #26313C; }}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e00035-s.e-ykrhga-e00035-s{& { overflow: hidden; }}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0004y-s.e-ykrhga-e0004y-s{& { border-bottom: 1px solid #26313C; }}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0005v-s.e-ykrhga-e0005v-s{& { border-top: 1px solid #26313C; }}</style>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00001 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00001-s " data-id="e00001" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00001">
    <section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00002 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00002-s " data-id="e00002" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00002">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00003 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00003-s " data-id="e00003" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00003">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00004 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00004-s " data-id="e00004" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00004">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00005-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00005">BACKHAUL</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00006-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00006">2,400 VEHICLES · UK &amp; IRELAND</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00007 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00007-s " data-id="e00007" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00007">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00008 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00008-s " data-id="e00008" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00008">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00009-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00009">EMPTY RUNNING, SOLVED</p>
					<h1 data-interaction-id="e0000a" class="e-ykrhga-e0000a-s e-heading-base">Stop driving 140 empty miles home.</h1>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000b">Backhaul finds a paying load going the direction you are already going, on the day you are already going. Average empty running down 31 percent across 2,400 vehicles, and you get paid in three days.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000c-s " data-id="e0000c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000c">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000d"><a href="#signup" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Sign up with your O-licence
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000e">No monthly fee. No tie-in.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000f-s " data-id="e0000f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000g-s " data-id="e0000g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000h-s " data-id="e0000h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000h">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000i">LIVE LOADS</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000j">1,847</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000k">posted in the last 24 hours, every one with the rate on the card.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000l-s " data-id="e0000l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000m-s " data-id="e0000m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000m">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000n">DAVENTRY → CARLISLE</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000o">£2.06</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000p-s " data-id="e0000p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000p">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000q">AVONMOUTH → HULL</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000r">£1.88</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000s-s " data-id="e0000s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000s">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000t">DOVER → WARRINGTON</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000u">£1.97</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000v-s " data-id="e0000v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000v">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000w-s " data-id="e0000w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000w">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000x">RATE PER MILE</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000y-s " data-id="e0000y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000y">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000z">£1.94</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00010-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00010">artic, accepted this week</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00011-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00011">Average accepted rate this week: £1.94 a mile for artic, £1.42 for 7.5 tonne. Every load shows the rate before you tap, not after a phone call.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00012 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00012-s " data-id="e00012" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00012">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00013 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00013-s " data-id="e00013" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00013">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00014-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00014">EMPTY RUNNING</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00015 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00015-s " data-id="e00015" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00015">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00016-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00016">18.6%</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00017-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00017">down from 27%</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00018-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00018">Fleet average empty running fell from 27 percent to 18.6 percent in the first six months. That is the whole product in one number.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00019 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00019-s " data-id="e00019" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00019">
    			<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0001a-s" data-interaction-id="e0001a" id="36" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-backhaul-freight-truck_dusk.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-backhaul-freight-truck_dusk.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-backhaul-freight-truck_dusk-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-backhaul-freight-truck_dusk-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="Articulated lorry on a motorway at dusk"/>		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001b-s " data-id="e0001b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001b">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001c-s " data-id="e0001c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001c">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001d e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0001d-s " data-id="e0001d" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001d">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001e-s " data-id="e0001e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001e">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0001f-s" data-interaction-id="e0001f" id="35" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-backhaul-freight-loading_bay.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-backhaul-freight-loading_bay.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-backhaul-freight-loading_bay-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-backhaul-freight-loading_bay-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="Pallets being loaded at a warehouse loading bay"/>		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001g-s " data-id="e0001g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001g">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001h">PAYMENT</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0001i" class="e-ykrhga-e0001i-s e-heading-base">Three working days, and what it costs you.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001j">Paid three working days after POD upload, for a flat 2 percent. Wait the standard 45 days and it costs you nothing.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001k e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0001k-s " data-id="e0001k" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001l-s " data-id="e0001l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001m">2%</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001n">flat fee, paid on day three. £480 load, £9.60 to you, money in the account on Wednesday.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001o-s " data-id="e0001o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001o">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001p">£0</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001q">if you can wait the standard 45 days. Same load, same rate, no deduction at all.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001r-s " data-id="e0001r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001r">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001s-s " data-id="e0001s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001s">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001t e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0001t-s " data-id="e0001t" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001t">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001u-s " data-id="e0001u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001u">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001v">MATCHING</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0001w" class="e-ykrhga-e0001w-s e-heading-base">How it works on a return leg.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001x-s " data-id="e0001x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001x">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001y">Tell us where you tip and when you need to be home. We look at loads within 40 miles of your route and rank them by what you actually earn after the deviation and the fuel.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001z e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0001z-s " data-id="e0001z" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00020 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00020-s " data-id="e00020" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00020">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00021-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00021">01</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00022" class="e-ykrhga-e00022-s e-heading-base">Tip and tell us</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00023-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00023">Log where you are tipping and the hour you need to be back on the yard. Twenty seconds, in the cab.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00024 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00024-s " data-id="e00024" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00024">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00025-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00025">02</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00026" class="e-ykrhga-e00026-s e-heading-base">We search 40 miles</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00027-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00027">Every posted load within a 40 mile corridor of your route home, live, with the shipper's rate already attached.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00028 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00028-s " data-id="e00028" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00028">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00029-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00029">03</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002a" class="e-ykrhga-e0002a-s e-heading-base">Ranked on net</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002b">Deviation miles and fuel come off before you see the order. The top load is the one that actually pays best.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002c-s " data-id="e0002c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002c">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002d">04</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002e" class="e-ykrhga-e0002e-s e-heading-base">Tap and run it</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002f">Accept on the phone. Collection window, contact and paperwork land on the load before you set off.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002g-s " data-id="e0002g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002h-s " data-id="e0002h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002i e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0002i-s " data-id="e0002i" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0002i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002j-s " data-id="e0002j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002k-s " data-id="e0002k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002k">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002l" class="e-ykrhga-e0002l-s e-heading-base">DAVENTRY → CARLISLE</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002m">ARTIC · 233 MI</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002n-s " data-id="e0002n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002n">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002o">Shipper pays</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002p">£480.00</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002q-s " data-id="e0002q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002q">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002r">Backhaul takes 8%</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002s">−£38.40</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002t-s " data-id="e0002t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002t">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002u">You get</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002v">£441.60</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002w-s " data-id="e0002w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002w">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002x">RATES</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0002y" class="e-ykrhga-e0002y-s e-heading-base">Both numbers on the card.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002z">The shipper pays a rate, we take 8 percent, and both numbers are on the load card. No hidden margin and no rate that mysteriously drops at invoice.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00030-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00030"><strong>£1.94</strong> a mile for artic, <strong>£1.42</strong> for 7.5 tonne — the accepted averages this week, not an asking price.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00031 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00031-s " data-id="e00031" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00031">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00032 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00032-s " data-id="e00032" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00032">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00033 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00033-s " data-id="e00033" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00033">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00034 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00034-s " data-id="e00034" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00034">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00035 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00035-s " data-id="e00035" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00035">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e00036-s" data-interaction-id="e00036" id="34" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-backhaul-freight-driver_cab.jpg" width="768" height="1024" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-backhaul-freight-driver_cab.jpg 768w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-backhaul-freight-driver_cab-225x300.jpg 225w" alt="Owner-operator driver in the cab of an artic at a truck stop"/>		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00037 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00037-s " data-id="e00037" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00037">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00038-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00038">VETTING</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00039-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00039">Every shipper is credit-checked and every carrier's O-licence, insurance and CPC are verified before the first load. Two missed payments and a shipper is removed, permanently.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003a-s " data-id="e0003a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003a">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0003b" class="e-ykrhga-e0003b-s e-heading-base">Who is allowed to post a load.</h2>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003c-s " data-id="e0003c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003c">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003d-s " data-id="e0003d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003d">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003e">✓</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003f-s " data-id="e0003f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003f">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003g" class="e-ykrhga-e0003g-s e-heading-base">Credit-checked shippers</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003h">Every account runs through a credit file before it can post. Limits are set on what they can owe at any one time.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003i-s " data-id="e0003i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003j-s " data-id="e0003j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003j">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003k">✓</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003l-s " data-id="e0003l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003l">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003m" class="e-ykrhga-e0003m-s e-heading-base">O-licence verified</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003n">Operator licence checked against the traffic commissioner's register, with the disc number on file.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003o-s " data-id="e0003o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003p-s " data-id="e0003p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003p">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003q">✓</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003r-s " data-id="e0003r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003r">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003s" class="e-ykrhga-e0003s-s e-heading-base">Insurance and CPC on file</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003t">Goods in transit, public liability and driver CPC, all dated and re-checked before they lapse.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003u-s " data-id="e0003u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003u">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003v-s " data-id="e0003v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003v">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003w">✓</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003x-s " data-id="e0003x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003x">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003y" class="e-ykrhga-e0003y-s e-heading-base">Two strikes, permanently</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003z">Two missed payments and the shipper is removed. Not suspended, not warned again — removed.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00040 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00040-s " data-id="e00040" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00040">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00041 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00041-s " data-id="e00041" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00041">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00042 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00042-s " data-id="e00042" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00042">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00043 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00043-s " data-id="e00043" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00043">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00044-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00044">PAPERWORK</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00045" class="e-ykrhga-e00045-s e-heading-base">The POD lives on the load, not in your cab door.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00046-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00046">Photograph the POD, it is attached and timestamped. CMR, weight tickets and defect reports all live on the load, so the office is not chasing you at nine at night.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00047 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00047-s " data-id="e00047" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00047">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00048-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00048">9 sec</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00049-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00049">median time from photographing a POD to it being attached, timestamped and visible to the shipper's accounts team. The three-day clock starts on that upload.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004a e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0004a-s " data-id="e0004a" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0004a">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004b-s " data-id="e0004b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004b">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004c">POD</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004d">Photographed, timestamped, geotagged at the tip.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004e-s " data-id="e0004e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004e">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004f">CMR</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004g">Attached on international loads before collection.</p>
		
